{"seq":2,"slug":"the-berkshire-empire","title":"伯克希尔帝国","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/core-contributions/the-berkshire-empire","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-insurance-float-model","title":"保险浮存金模式","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/core-contributions/the-berkshire-empire/the-insurance-float-model","wordCount":1703,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-conglomerate","title":"多元企业集团","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/core-contributions/the-berkshire-empire/the-conglomerate","wordCount":1744,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 伯克希尔帝国\n\n巴菲特把伯克希尔打造成独特的投资控股帝国。本章揭示这一帝国的运作内核。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"保险浮存金模式\"——他如何用低成本的保险浮存金为投资提供弹药。第二篇文档讲述\"多元企业集团\",呈现这个横跨百业、以资本配置为中枢的独特帝国。\n"}